"                                            the work timetable set by the First Party, who will have the right,\n"
"                                            in case of any violation thereof, to impose the penalties he deems suitable\n"
"                                            in accordance with the Company's Internal Bylaw and the requirements\n"
"                                            of the Saudi Labour Law."
